{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1117","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1117/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1117/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1117/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1117","id":388220533,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzODgyMjA1MzM=","number":1117,"title":"Psalm allows implementing class method signature mismatch with interface __construct requirement ","user":{"login":"aidantwoods","id":3288888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg4ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3288888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods","html_url":"https://github.com/aidantwoods","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2018-12-06T13:45:42Z","updated_at":"2018-12-13T03:35:32Z","closed_at":"2018-12-13T03:35:32Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Given an interface with a no-argument constructor requirement, Psalm allows an implementing class to specify a constructor with an incompatible method signature (note that this does not occur with methods other than the constructor, where Psalm will report an error as expected):\r\n\r\nhttps://getpsalm.org/r/b81b031436\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n  \r\ninterface Foo\r\n{\r\n    public function __construct();\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Bar implements Foo\r\n{\r\n    /** @var bool */\r\n    private $foo;\r\n\r\n    public function __construct(bool $foo)\r\n    {\r\n        $this->foo = $foo;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nPsalm output (using commit 5f34f6c):\r\n```\r\nNo issues!\r\n```\r\nExpected (something like):\r\n```\r\nERROR: MethodSignatureMismatch - 13:5 - Method Bar::__construct has more required parameters than parent method Foo::__construct\r\n```\r\n\r\nOf course, something like `public function __construct(bool $foo = true)` should be permitted.","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1117/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1117/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}